       <section class="puzzle hidden" data-answer="0">
        <p data-template-id="q4-category" class="canva-tag mono mb-3" style="color: rgb(233, 250, 115); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">04 / PARADOKS KECIL</p>
        <h2 data-template-id="q4-question" class="canva-text font-bold leading-snug mb-7" style="color: rgb(245, 244, 233); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 24px;">Ada 100 loker tertutup. Pada putaran ke-n, setiap loker bernomor kelipatan n dibalik keadaannya. Setelah 100 putaran, berapa loker terbuka?</h2>
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3"><button type="button" data-template-id="q4-a" class="canva-button choice rounded-xl p-4 font-semibold" style="background: rgb(35, 52, 51); color: rgb(245, 244, 233); font-weight: 600; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">A. 10 loker</button> <button type="button" data-template-id="q4-b" class="canva-button choice rounded-xl p-4 font-semibold" style="background: rgb(35, 52, 51); color: rgb(245, 244, 233); font-weight: 600; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">B. 25 loker</button> <button type="button" data-template-id="q4-c" class="canva-button choice rounded-xl p-4 font-semibold" style="background: rgb(35, 52, 51); color: rgb(245, 244, 233); font-weight: 600; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">C. 50 loker</button> <button type="button" data-template-id="q4-d" class="canva-button choice rounded-xl p-4 font-semibold" style="background: rgb(35, 52, 51); color: rgb(245, 244, 233); font-weight: 600; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">D. 100 loker</button>
